OL,3,GNEWSANew chapter for city's last       
OL,4,Apenmaker                               
OL,6,FStaff want to safeguard skills that    
OL,7,Fhave all but disappeared since the     
OL,8,Flocal industry peaked in the 19th      
OL,9,FCentury, when it produced about three  
OL,10,Fquarters of the world's pens.          
OL,12,F"You have to keep this heritage alive  
OL,13,Fbecause once it's gone, it never comes 
OL,14,Fback," said co-owner Giles English, who
OL,15,Fdescribes himself as the company's     
OL,16,Fcustodian.                             
